[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0010","text":"啊……得去浇水了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0020","text":"怎么了，甜花酱？\n用手机浇水……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0030","text":"嗯、嗯……是游戏，啦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0040","text":"把花……养到开花的话……\n能拿到，道具……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0050","text":"诶——！\n甜花酱的花，是什么样的呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0060","text":"──哇，好多啊！\n这些全都是甜花酱在养的吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0070","text":"嗯……因为想要好多……\n种了……50棵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0080","text":"哇，好厉害……！\n呵呵，每一棵都在摇摇晃晃的，好可爱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0090","text":"等花开了一定更漂亮吧……\n到时候，能再给我看看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0100","text":"嗯……！　我会好好照顾它们，让它们开花……\n把道具，拿到手……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_04_0102","text":"Motion"}]
